+<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>组合活动 · 业务流程图</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:110px}body{margin:0;background:#f2f3f5;color:#27313e;font:15px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:3;background:#fffffff5;border-bottom:1px solid #dce1e6;padding:16px 24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}h1{font-size:19px;margin:0}a{color:#445e7b;text-decoration:none}a:hover{text-decoration:underline}nav{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:14px}main{max-width:1160px;margin:32px auto;padding:0 20px}section{background:white;border:1px solid #dce1e6;border-radius:8px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:32px}h2{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 6px}p{color:#758090;margin:0 0 16px}.links{display:flex;gap:22px;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:24px}.diagram{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto}footer{text-align:center;color:#85909d;font-size:12px;padding:0 20px 32px}@media(max-width:760px){header{padding:12px 16px;gap:8px}h1{font-size:17px}nav{gap:12px;font-size:12px}main{margin-top:20px;padding:0 12px}section{padding:18px 12px}h2{font-size:18px}}</style></head><body><header><h1>组合活动 · 业务流程图</h1><nav><a href="index.html">返回页面状态连线图</a><a href="#entry">1. 参与校验与普通券发放</a><a href="#lottery">2. 独立抽奖</a><a href="#result">3. 结果展示与升级回流</a></nav></header><main><section id="entry"><h2>01 · 参与校验与普通券发放</h2><p>页面加载、组合活动时间、登录、OneID、活动资格匹配及普通券发放。</p><div class="links"><a href="flows/entry.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">打开原尺寸图</a><a href="flows/entry.mmd" download>下载 Mermaid 源稿</a></div><img class="diagram" src="flows/entry.svg" alt="参与校验与普通券发放流程图"></section><section id="lottery"><h2>02 · 独立抽奖</h2><p>每次参与检查符合资格且未参加的抽奖，按中奖结果发券并记录参与。</p><div class="links"><a href="flows/lottery.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">打开原尺寸图</a><a href="flows/lottery.mmd" download>下载 Mermaid 源稿</a></div><img class="diagram" src="flows/lottery.svg" alt="独立抽奖流程图"></section><section id="result"><h2>03 · 结果展示与升级回流</h2><p>按实际领取结果展示卡券，认证在绑车前；完成升级后手动重新参与。</p><div class="links"><a href="flows/result.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">打开原尺寸图</a><a href="flows/result.mmd" download>下载 Mermaid 源稿</a></div><img class="diagram" src="flows/result.svg" alt="结果展示与升级回流流程图"></section></main><footer>静态原型评审示意 · 不调用真实业务接口</footer></body></html>
